# UX workflow: start sequencer playback and observe playhead progression.
# Purpose: validates SDL sequencer runtime parity with hardware by checking
# transport dispatch, screen captures, and trace-level playhead telemetry.
# Expect: playhead_progress

0 scenario sequencer
50 capture screen sequencer_ready

# Enable one visible step so playback has an audible/visible musical target.
150 tap MACRO_1 60
300 capture screen step_enabled

# Start transport and give the runtime enough time to advance at default tempo.
400 tap BOTTOM_CENTER 60
650 capture screen playing_early
1400 tick
1500 capture screen playing_late

# Stop transport and capture the settled UI state.
1650 tap BOTTOM_CENTER 60
1850 capture screen stopped
